{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d000000000000020","type":"group","x":80,"y":1280,"width":1300,"height":720,"color":"6","label":"Mixed node group — hidden when every contained node is hidden"},
		{"id":"d000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# Canvas Folding demo\n\nFollow the four cards below. Canvas Folding reads hierarchy from directed edges and changes only the view — never this file.","x":-800,"y":-720,"width":760,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Basic tree\n\nUse the −/+ control on **Basic root**. Try the control menu for level views. **Isolated** remains visible when all rooted branches are collapsed.","x":-800,"y":-400,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d000000000000003","type":"text","text":"Basic root","x":-250,"y":-330,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d000000000000004","type":"text","text":"Upper child","x":150,"y":-430,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000005","type":"text","text":"Grandchild","x":550,"y":-430,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000006","type":"text","text":"Lower child","x":150,"y":-210,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d000000000000007","type":"text","text":"Isolated","x":550,"y":-160,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"d000000000000018","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Groups and node types\n\nCollapse **Mixed root**: text, note, link, image, edges, and the surrounding group disappear. Focus it instead: the complete group remains active.","x":-800,"y":1320,"width":420,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d000000000000008","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Shared descendant\n\nCollapse **Parent A**. The shared branch disappears and both parents show +. Expand through **Parent B** without revealing hidden parent nodes.","x":-810,"y":185,"width":430,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d000000000000014","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Directed cycle\n\nThis graph has no root. Collapse all does not affect it, but each node control can fold and expand a finite branch without looping.","x":-810,"y":720,"width":430,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d000000000000015","type":"text","text":"Cycle A","x":-260,"y":800,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d000000000000016","type":"text","text":"Cycle B","x":130,"y":680,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d000000000000017","type":"text","text":"Cycle C","x":130,"y":940,"width":220,"height":80,"color":"5"},
